Package: h2oplyr
Type: Package
Title: Tidy Data Manipulation on Remote 'H2O' Frames
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Carlos", "Ortega", email = "cof@qualityexcellence.es", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides selection, filtering, mutation, aggregation, joins,
    reshaping and window operations on remote 'H2O' frames. Data manipulation
    is delegated to 'H2O'; no local table backend is used. Includes an English
    tutorial and reproducible examples using Palmer penguin measurements.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: h2o (>= 3.44.0.3)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 8), a running H2O cluster matching the h2o
        R package version
NeedsCompilation: no
